    "author_association": "OWNER",
    "body": "# FAIL-CLOSED CORRECTION — 2026-08-29\n\nA forbidden execution substitution occurred again: instead of the required live ComfyUI masked edit path, ChatGPT image generation was invoked and produced a full-frame redraw.\n\nStatus of that PNG: INVALID / QUARANTINED / DO NOT USE.\n\nDurable prevention law:\n- For ZORR character pose/edit tasks, ChatGPT image generation is FORBIDDEN.\n- Allowed visual execution path is only the approved live ComfyUI masked edit/inpaint+stitch path (or another OWNER-approved exact local edit executor).\n- If the live ComfyUI bridge/runtime is unreachable from the current session, the task must return BLOCKED_COMFYUI_BRIDGE and MUST NOT substitute any other generator.\n- Whole-frame redraw is never evidence for HARD PROBLEM #001.\n\nThis supersedes any prior behavior that tried to 'continue to PASS' by using a different image engine.",
